# 私有页面禁止搜索引擎收录（SPA 路由由 index.html 承载，需按路径打标）
/admin
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/admin/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/user
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/user/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/redeem
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/redeem/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/telegram_mail
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/telegram_mail/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

# 各语言前缀（如 /en/user）下的私有页面同样禁止收录
/*/admin
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/*/admin/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/*/user
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/*/user/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/*/redeem
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/*/redeem/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/*/telegram_mail
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/*/telegram_mail/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
